# Survivor Edition — independent modified edition
<color_light_cyan>Cataclysm: Dark Days Ahead — Survivor Edition</color>
<color_white>Edition version: 1.0.0-rc.1. Based on CDDA 0.I (Ito).</color>

This is an independent modified edition. It is not created or endorsed by the CDDA team.
The first release preserves the CDDA gameplay rules. Original game and resource authors are identified in Credits and the distribution's license notices.

<color_white>Getting started</color>
Create a world and character through New Game. Press Enter in gameplay for the action menu; ? shows your key bindings. Help is available with 0.
Shift+S saves the game and returns to the main menu. Keep the window open while saving.

Edition saves and settings use a separate user profile. See README_EN.md next to the game.

